The third Figure requires that the middle Term be the Subject of both the Premisses. It has six Moods (viz.) Darapti, Felapton, Disamis, Datifi, Bocardo, Ferison: And it admits only of particular Conclusions; as,
Da- Whofoever loves God shall be saved;
rap- All the Lovers of God have their Imperfections;
ti. Therefore some who have Imperfections shall be saved.
